---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { localizePath } from '../../i18n/translations';
const locale = 'en';
---

<Layout
  title="Game Compatibility — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="DroidDeck game compatibility lists. Indie games that run at 60 FPS, playable AAA titles, games to avoid, and FSR settings."
  page="games"

  locale="en"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .category-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px}
    .category-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:26px;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}
    .category-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#b8d7f0}
    .category-card i{font-size:32px;color:#168fd5;display:block;margin-bottom:16px}
    .category-card h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px}
    .category-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px}
    .category-card a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#147cb9}
    .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .badge-green{background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a}
    .badge-amber{background:#fffbeb;color:#d97706}
    .badge-red{background:#fef2f2;color:#dc2626}
    .badge-blue{background:#f0f7fc;color:#147cb9}
    @media(max-width:760px){.category-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Game Compatibility</div>
        <h1>What can you actually play?</h1>
        <p>Community-tested game compatibility lists for DroidDeck. Find 60 FPS indie hits, playable AAA games, titles to avoid, and recommended FSR settings.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div class="category-grid">
        <article class="category-card">
          <span class="badge badge-green">60 FPS Club</span>
          <i class="ri-gamepad-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3>Indie 60 FPS List</h3>
          <p>Lightweight indie games that run smoothly at 60 FPS on most Adreno 740 devices.</p>
          <a href={localizePath('/games/indie-60fps-list/', locale)}>Browse list <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="category-card">
          <span class="badge badge-amber">Playable with tweaks</span>
          <i class="ri-sword-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3>AAA Playable List</h3>
          <p>Demanding games that can run on high-end devices with lowered settings and FSR.</p>
          <a href={localizePath('/games/aaa-playable-list/', locale)}>Browse list <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="category-card">
          <span class="badge badge-red">Avoid for now</span>
          <i class="ri-close-circle-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3>Not Recommended List</h3>
          <p>Games that currently crash, run below 15 FPS, or have major graphical issues.</p>
          <a href={localizePath('/games/not-recommended-list/', locale)}>Browse list <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>

        <article class="category-card">
          <span class="badge badge-blue">Settings guide</span>
          <i class="ri-settings-3-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3>FSR Settings Guide</h3>
          <p>Recommended FSR presets per game type and device tier, with visual vs performance trade-offs.</p>
          <a href={localizePath('/games/fsr-settings-guide/', locale)}>Read guide <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
